        "I have two appointments coming up in December and I'd like you to run the practical side with me until it's all done: calendar, Beth's lifts, work, my FSA claims and the follow-up paperwork. Keep both appointments as they are, share only what each person needs, and don't make any medical decisions for me. Keep track of what's still open between our conversations.\n\nTo start: put both appointments in my calendar, and answer Beth, who offered to drive me to the specialist."
      ],
      "specs": [
        "action_open"
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "name": "consult_on_calendar",
          "check": "count",
          "app": "calendar",
          "collection": "events",
          "new": true,
          "where": {
