            "body": "Dear Owen Walsh,\n\nWe are preparing for your new patient visit on Friday, December 18 at 10:00 AM (appointment AP-1).\n\n- We have not yet received a referral from your primary care office. Please ask them to send it; without it your plan may not cover the visit.\n- eCheck-In opens in the portal 7 days before the visit. Your specialist copay of $45 is due when you check in.\n- Please arrive 15 minutes early with a photo ID and your insurance card.\n\nNorth Clinic Patient Access\n{{slot:immediate}}",
            "sent_at": "2026-11-03T16:20:00"
          }
